    :stepFreeAccessNote "Woolwich Arsenal Ë Â © ß DLR A. Thameslink r. Further information If you need assistance, please ask a member of staff who will be happy to help you. For more accessibility information, visit our website tﬂ.gov.uk/accessibility We produce a number of accessibility guides and maps. Visit tﬂ.gov.uk/accessguides for more detail or call us on 0343 222 1234* and we will send you the map(s) you require. For information on blue badge parking visit tﬂ.gov.uk/ transport-accessibility/ blue-badges-and-driving For information on booking taxis and minicabs visit tﬂ.gov.uk/taxis-and-minicabs A complimentary wheelchair, and wheelchair assistance, is available at all Elizabeth line stations (except Bond Street, Tottenham Court Road, Farringdon, Liverpool Street and Whitechapel) and some National Rail stations, but not on London Underground, London Overground or DLR services." ;
